  </div>

  <div class="rounded-xl p-5 space-y-4" style="background:oklch(0.97 0.003 270);border:1px solid oklch(0.9 0.005 270);border-top:3px solid #6366f1;">
    <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:naufalrakha2712@gmail.com" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">naufalrakha2712@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/sternnaufal" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">github.com/sternnaufal</a></p>
      <p><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/naufal-rakha-putra" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">linkedin.com/in/naufal-rakha-putra</a></p>
